  << /ActualText (Aim\072 Make wellbeing tasks approachable and sustainable\024calm visuals\054 inclusive onboarding\054 and small\054 guided steps\056\nMethods\072\nPurpose Story Script \024 Clear \034why\035 for daily wellbeing routines\056\nCalm Clarity Tuning \024 Low cognitive load \050hierarchy\057contrast\057micro\021feedback\051\056\nInclusive Onboarding Paths \024 Language\057ability options\073 welcoming flows\056\nSmall\021Step Actions \024 Micro\021steps with confirmations to build habit\056\nImpact Dashboard \024 Progress\057milestones for motivation and retention\056\nSensory Wayfinding Map \024 Simple cues\057icons that make finding help intuitive\056\nResult\072 Users start small\054 feel supported\054 and keep going\024a gentle system that turns intention into routine\056)
     /K [ 294 ]
